@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:第二天，时间过得很缓慢。|#0102Adv17_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大概是因为昨天的打击太大，<br>大家都缩在各自的牢房里，不愿出门。|#0102Adv17_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛也无所事事，<br>只是在毫无意义地摆弄手机。|#0102Adv17_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_9_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我现在是不是应该<br>　去探望一下米莉亚比较好？）|#0102Adv17_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（还是说，等她明天出来<br>　我再来问她）|#0102Adv17_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（问她为什么要毁掉热气球）|#0102Adv17_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛呆呆望着手机上的囚犯列表，叹了口气。|#0102Adv17_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在这时，她不小心误触了手机，<br>不仅申请加米莉亚为好友，还给她打了电话。|#0102Adv17_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:哇哇……！|#0102Adv17_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这完全只是误触。但没想到的是——<br>打给米莉亚的电话竟然接通了。|#0102Adv17_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎！？米、米莉亚！？|#0102Adv17_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛吓了一跳，但还是慌忙把手机贴在耳朵上。|#0102Adv17_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：電話

[PrintTextModified Text:——啊，是樱羽艾玛小姐吗。|#0102Adv17_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长！？咦，为什么是你！？|#0102Adv17_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：電話

[PrintTextModified Text:没为什么……<br>我只是正好来惩罚室检查囚犯的情况。|#0102Adv17_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：電話

[PrintTextModified Text:然后我就看到手机有来电，<br>所以替她接电话而已。|#0102Adv17_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚呢！？米莉亚她没事吧！？|#0102Adv17_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：電話

[PrintTextModified Text:她好着呢。哎呀呀……<br>你们不停地闹出问题，害得我的工作量都增加了，<br>求你们放过我吧……|#0102Adv17_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：電話

[PrintTextModified Text:也许我得挑个日子杀鸡儆猴了。再见。|#0102Adv17_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:电话被挂断了。|#0102Adv17_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛呆呆地低头望着手机。|#0102Adv17_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

