[PrintTextModified Text:一股不祥的预感袭上心头。<br>艾玛感觉仿佛心脏被狠狠揪紧了一样，<br>疾速的心跳令她不禁捂住胸口。|#0102Adv17_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Cry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:（和发现诺亚的时候一样……）|#0102Adv17_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请、请你们马上过来……！|#0102Adv17_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉点点头，<br>跟在汉娜身后跑了起来。|#0102Adv17_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

