[PrintTextModified Text:在汉娜的带领下，<br>艾玛一行人来到了<br>地下惩罚室旁的过道。|#0102Adv17_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Cry1,Angle01/Option_Arms-
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Cry
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Cry1,ArmR5,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露、可可和安安已经等在那里了。<br>三人紧紧依靠在一起，哭个不停。|#0102Adv17_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可和安安哭得尤为激动，<br>梅露露在身边安抚她们。|#0102Adv17_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Cry
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛小姐……|#0102Adv17_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，到底发生什么了……|#0102Adv17_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛从干哑到几乎发不出声的喉咙里<br>努力挤出一句话。|#0102Adv17_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Cry

; ＠備考◆泣きながら

[PrintTextModified Text:在惩罚室里面，米莉亚小姐她被……|#0102Adv17_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Cry1,ArmR5,ArmL5

; ＠備考◆泣きながら

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔被捅了！但是门打不开！<br>她可能还活着啊！？<br>快把门打开啊，喂！|#0102Adv17_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉就站在<br>可可指着的门前。|#0102Adv17_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（米莉亚被捅了……？<br>　怎么会这样，为什么……）|#0102Adv17_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不敢置信，<br>只觉得头晕目眩。|#0102Adv17_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛。|#0102Adv17_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:连雪莉也被吓得面无血色，<br>她紧紧握住艾玛的手。|#0102Adv17_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也许是因为她发现艾玛快要晕倒了。<br>也许是为了维持自己的理智。|#0102Adv17_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:两人手牵着手，仿佛两颗残破不堪的心灵正互相扶持着。<br>她们一同从门上的小窗<br>看向惩罚室里。|#0102Adv17_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……|#0102Adv17_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚的身上血流成河——<br>那场面实在惨不忍睹。|#0102Adv17_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不忍心看下去了，拼命忍住瞬间涌上来的反胃感。<br>这时，雪莉松开了她的手。|#0102Adv17_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，请你后退一点。|#0102Adv17_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉的声音有些僵硬，<br>说完，她确认艾玛已经退后一步后，<br>握住挂在惩罚室门前的锁——|#0102Adv17_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

