[PrintTextModified Text:然后用怪力魔法徒手把锁扯了下来。|#0102Adv17_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:惩罚室的门开了，<br>艾玛等人走进里面。|#0102Adv17_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

