; @bgm Bgm_23_1

[PrintTextModified Text:——拥有成人人格的少女，佐伯米莉亚。<br>她空洞的眼里已经失去了光芒。|#0102Adv17_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她被束缚在十字架处刑台上，<br>看样子是被刺了很多下，<br>从胸部到腹部均有大量出血。|#0102Adv17_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:鲜红的血液化作无数只蝴蝶<br>飞舞在十字架的周围，<br>仿佛在点缀少女神圣的死亡。|#0102Adv17_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚的魔法还没消失啊。|#0102Adv17_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉呢喃道。|#0102Adv17_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚她……真的被捅了吗？|#0102Adv17_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她喜欢看电影……<br>所以，会不会是特效妆？最好确认一下。|#0102Adv17_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安一边说着，摇摇晃晃地走了进来，<br>艾玛她们听了一惊。|#0102Adv17_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（是啊，说不定她还活着……！）|#0102Adv17_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露！|#0102Adv17_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到雪莉的呼唤，梅露露也走了进来。<br>如果她还有呼吸，就能用梅露露的魔法治疗。|#0102Adv17_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们急忙跑到米莉亚身边，<br>确认她的情况。|#0102Adv17_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露伸出发光的手，<br>触碰米莉亚。|#0102Adv17_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，她很快就痛苦地摇了摇头。|#0102Adv17_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不行……她已经过世了。|#0102Adv17_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便化成蝴蝶，<br>那股刺鼻的血腥味依旧还在。|#0102Adv17_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，米莉亚尸体的惨状<br>实在叫人不忍心直视。|#0102Adv17_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

